    "body": "The independent clean-cache audit found three completion defects: Bounty Hunters is written under a path the endpoint does not read, the Vanilla Weapons endpoint loads only the base file instead of all seven active layers, and the PSIN snapshot source still depends on the separate C:\\RDR2Mod developer checkout. The verifier also failed to catch these states. I moved this back to actionable and am correcting the paths, bundled resources, layer loading, and acceptance checks.",
